# Version history

This folder is a local git repo (no remote). Use it so any change can be compared or rolled back.

- Commit after every change the user approves, with a one-line message that says what changed.
- Commit before a risky or wide change (refactors, removing code, layout rewrites).
- Before declaring a regression fixed, `git diff` against the last good commit to find what changed.
- Never rewrite or delete history, and never push, unless the user asks.
- `sales-deck-original/videos/` is ignored on purpose (large, unchanging). Posters stay tracked.
